{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/7b3237597bca42a35855b7ed356751e1.poster.avif?t=1756482267\" width=472 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/7b3237597bca42a35855b7ed356751e1.webm?t=1756482267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/7b3237597bca42a35855b7ed356751e1.mp4?t=1756482267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>What's your favorite color? Would you eat meatballs for the rest of your life? Are dogs really that cute?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the perfect day, break the cycle, and discover the truth about yourself in <i>Endling</i>, a short, quirky sci-fi mystery about freedom, choice, and loneliness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Lifetime of Choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life is full of hard questions and difficult choices\u2014but who says exploring them can't be fun?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as each new day brings more questions and curious changes. Marvel as your surroundings twist and turn to accommodate your every wish. But how\u2014and to what end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This quizzical first-person game will have you wondering, guessing, contemplating\u2014but it will take an inquisitive mind and a fondness for reckless destruction to really get to the bottom of things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by other story-driven, short-form games,<i> Endling</i>\u00a0features not only a mind-boggling, soul-searching story, but also home-thrashing excellence and unparalleled high-octane beach ball action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Perfect Day Just Got Better</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in 2021, this school-project-turned-indie-hit finally makes its Steam debut, featuring a slew of exciting improvements including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced graphics and lightning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded UI, audio, and subtitles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better stuff-breaking physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of puzzling achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug fixes of every magnitude</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best of all, <i>Endling</i> is<i> still</i>\u00a0free to keep and play! We want everyone to have the chance to live the perfect day\u2014over, and over again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/4194b1e4b7c32d910fbc817cd8cc47f6.poster.avif?t=1756482267\" width=574 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/4194b1e4b7c32d910fbc817cd8cc47f6.webm?t=1756482267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/4194b1e4b7c32d910fbc817cd8cc47f6.mp4?t=1756482267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2424490?t=1756482267","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2424490?t=1756482267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/20bc162766e2952291d155c399d44b3ee1e1e616/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756482267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/20bc162766e2952291d155c399d44b3ee1e1e616/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=175648226