aralleled high-octane beach ball action.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Perfect Day Just Got Better</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally released in 2021, this school-project-turned-indie-hit finally makes its Steam debut, featuring a slew of exciting improvements including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced graphics and lightning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgraded UI, audio, and subtitles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Better stuff-breaking physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A ton of puzzling achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug fixes of every magnitude</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best of all, <i>Endling</i> is<i> still</i>\u00a0free to keep and play! We want everyone to have the chance to live the perfect day\u2014over, and over again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/4194b1e4b7c32d910fbc817cd8cc47f6.poster.avif?t=1756482267\" width=574 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/4194b1e4b7c32d910fbc817cd8cc47f6.webm?t=1756482267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/extras/4194b1e4b7c32d910fbc817cd8cc47f6.mp4?t=1756482267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Team Humans"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424490/f0b49072a1f020826a266cb06047855ef611a8da/header.jpg?t=1756482267","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=